  "problem": "Let $a$ denote the approximation of $g(1)$ found in part 5. According to the alternating series error bound, we have that \n\n$$\n|g(1)-a|<k\n$$\n\n for some real number $k.$ Find the value of $k.$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $k\\,=\\,$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
